    "body": "Probably anything that goes trough https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax/#tokenization … except I suppose text nodes that happen to be in a `<style>` element. Stylo also does replacement (of surrogates to U+FFFD) there when parsing a stylesheet, but I don’t think that case can be as neatly expressed though use of `CSSOMString`.",
