    "created_at": "2017-04-22T04:54:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-22T04:54:24Z",
    "body": "\"Might\" seems rather bad. Can't we just have an explicit entry point for bytes and one for code points? (And yes, as defined a scalar value is a code point: https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#scalar-value.)",
